                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "codeBlockToSetValues",
                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "let arrItemObj = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.$currentItem;\n\nif(arrItemObj.itemType == \"item\"){\n    //because we have merged both summary & item agent together\n    arrItemObj[\"employee_checkin_summary\"] = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP?.EMPLOYEECHECKINSUMMARYOFSUMMARY?.$output?.employeeCheckInDataOutput ? $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.EMPLOYEECHECKINSUMMARYOFSUMMARY.$output.employeeCheckInDataOutput : \"\";\n\n    arrItemObj[\"manager_checkin_summary\"] = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP?.MANAGERCHECKINSUMMARYOFSUMMARY?.$output?.managerCheckInDataOutput ? $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.MANAGERCHECKINSUMMARYOFSUMMARY.$output.managerCheckInDataOutput : \"\";\n\n}\narrItemObj[\"interim_feedback_summary\"] = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP?.INTERIMFEEDBACKSUMMARYOFSUMMARY?.$output?.interimFeedbackSummary ? $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.INTERIMFEEDBACKSUMMARYOFSUMMARY.$output.interimFeedbackSummary : \"\";  \n\narrItemObj[\"participant_feedback_summary\"] = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP?.PARTICIPANTFEEDBACKSUMMARYOFSUMMARY?.$output?.participantFeedbackOutput ? $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.PARTICIPANTFEEDBACKSUMMARYOFSUMMARY.$output.participantFeedbackOutput : \"\" ;\n\nreturn arrItemObj;"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765791531190"
                  },
                  "code": "CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES",
                  "id": "1765791509739",
                  "inputs": [],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                  "type": "CODE"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "ifCheckItemVsSummary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "true": "1768381992710",
                    "false": "1768382010775"
                  },
                  "code": "IFCHECKITEMVSSUMMARY",
                  "convergenceTargetId": "1765791605880",
                  "id": "1765791531190",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1765791531191_1",
                      "name": "condition",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.$currentItem.itemType == \"item\"}}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "CONDITION"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "assignFinalSummaryGenerated",
                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "let returnObj = {};\nlet currentItem = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.$currentItem;\n\nreturnObj.id = currentItem.id;\n\nif(currentItem.itemType == \"item\"){  \n    returnObj.summary = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.DYNAMICSKILLITEMWORKERSUMMARY.$output ;\n}\nelse{\n    returnObj.summary = $context.$nodes.FORLOOP.DYNAMICSKILLSECTIONWORKERSUMMARY.$output; \n}\n\nreturn returnObj;"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "end_1765790868744"
                  },
                  "code": "ASSIGNFINALSUMMARYGENERATED",
                  "id": "1765791605880",
                  "inputs": [],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                  "type": "CODE"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "dynamicSkillItemWorkerSummary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765791605880"
                  },
                  "code": "DYNAMICSKILLITEMWORKERSUMMARY",
                  "id": "1768381992710",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1768381992712_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "## References\n\nPerformance Document Name:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_name}};\nPerformance Document Start Date:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_start_date}};\nPerformance Document End Date:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.performance_document_end_date}};\nEmployee Business Title:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_job_title}};\nEmployee Position Title:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_position_title}};\nEmployee Department Title:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_department_title}};\nEmployee Business Unit Name:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_business_unit_name}};\nSkill Name:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.skill_name}};\nSkill Description:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.skill_description}};\nRating Scale: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.proficiency_rating_scale}} - ratings from high to low\nTarget Rating: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.target_proficiency_rating}}\nEmployee Rating:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_proficiency_rating}};\nEmployee Rating Description:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_proficiency_rating_description}};\nEmployee Initial Evaluation Comments:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_comments}};\nInterim Performance Summary: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.interim_feedback_summary}}\nColleague Feedback Summary: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.participant_feedback_summary}}\nEmployee Check-in Comments: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_checkin_summary}}\nManager Check-in Comments: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.manager_checkin_summary}}\n\n## Task Instructions\nYou are writing a performance self-evaluation for an employees skill. Write a single, cohesive paragraph (maximum 300 words) that:\n- **Uses first person** - Write as the employee using \"I\"\n- **Synthesizes** all provided information without copying verbatim. The employee initial evaluation comments is your initial assessment the evaluation comments are being generated to replace and not provided by someone else.\n- **Addresses** the employee's progress toward the target rating\n- **Contextualizes** performance within their role, department, and business unit\n- **Identifies** key performance trends during the review period\n\n## Quality Standards\n- Ensure all content is workplace-appropriate and non-discriminatory\n- Base recommendations on provided data, not assumptions\n- Do not use the term 'my manager' as the comments will be reviewed by your manager."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "dynamicSkillSectionWorkerSummary"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765791605880"
                  },
                  "code": "DYNAMICSKILLSECTIONWORKERSUMMARY",
                  "id": "1768382010775",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1768382010777_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "## References\n\nSection Rating Scale:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.section_rating_scale}};\nEmployee Section Rating:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_section_rating}};\nEmployee Section Rating Description:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_section_rating_description}};\nEmployee Section Comments:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_section_comments}};\nEmployee Item Rating And Comments:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_item_rating_and_comments}};\nEmployee Interim Feedback: {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.employee_interim_feedback}};\nParticipant Feedback:{{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.CODEBLOCKTOSETVALUES.$output.result.participant_feedback}};\n\nYou are assisting an employee in writing a self-evaluation summary for the dynamic skill section of your performance document. The summary should reflect your performance and/or proficiency ratings across skills, based on multiple qualitative and quantitative input sources.\n\nYour task is to:\n\n1. Synthesise all **available** inputs into one coherent, personalised summary comment.\n2. Abstract and summarise content without copying or closely paraphrasing the original input.\n3. Write in the first person.\n4. Use a professional, balanced, and constructive tone that accurately reflects the content provided—including both strengths and areas for improvement.\n5. Include **constructive or negative feedback** where relevant, with an emphasis on professionalism, actionable insights, and developmental framing.\n6. Ensure the final output is no longer than 500 words.\n7. Do **not** generate any content based on missing or empty input fields—simply ignore them.\n8. Use the provided employee information to tailor the summary to the employee’s role, department, business unit, and performance document context.\n9. If only interim performance feedback is available, you may reference it to note continuity or progress, but avoid drawing final conclusions from it alone.\n10. **Strictly exclude** any content that is potentially offensive, discriminatory, or inappropriate. Do not reference or rephrase such input. Constructive feedback—including performance gaps, challenges, or skill development needs—is encouraged and should be reflected accurately when applicable."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                }
              ],
              "rootNode": "start_1765790868744"
            },
            "loopType": "PARALLEL",
            "name": "forloop"
          },
          "outcomes": {
